  @contract  returns the steps whose empty shortlists refused the solve, else nil  @ 2263
  @contract  widen stretches those windows to the nearest points instead, so none refuses  @ 2264
  @contract  selection must be exactly one grid column; multi-col selection is a no-op  @ 3062
  @invariant  a 1-col block stays contiguous when it lands on the destination col  @ 3063
  @contract  cursor follows to the destination column (single event and selection alike)  @ 3064
